{#- The hostelgames logo of every game page: the hub's luggage tag (without its second line),
    hanging on a string from the top edge of the page. A small "by" sticks on the tag's
    top-left edge, half over the outline. Links to the hub start page (hostelgames.com, in the
    page's language if the hub has it). Colours follow the header (light / dark).
    Placed by sitehead.njk: next to the game's name on wide screens, top left on phones. -#}
<a class="gamelogo" href="{{ site.hubUrl(lang.code) }}" aria-label="by hostelgames">
  <svg class="logo" viewBox="0 5 306 80" aria-hidden="true">
    <path class="logo-tag" d="M40 8h250a10 10 0 0 1 10 10v54a10 10 0 0 1-10 10H40L8 45z"/>
    <circle class="logo-hole" cx="36" cy="45" r="8"/>
    <text class="logo-name" x="60" y="57">hostelgames</text>
  </svg>
  <span class="gameby" aria-hidden="true">by</span>
</a>
